inorganic matter such as  walls and earth allowing the user to  disassemble and reassemble the  battlefield around him in order to gain  an advantage over the opponent on top of  all of that if he disassembles parts of  his own body at the same time as the  parts of someone else's body  chisaki can reassemble them in a way  that essentially fuses the two people  together creating a fused and even more  powerful version of himself we see this  ability on full display during Chi sakis  epic showdown against Deku like  shigaraki chisaki appears incapable of  simply turning his quark off so he wears  special gloves that allow him to keep  his power in check another drawback is  that using his quirk appears to have  physical consequences on chi sake it  leads him to develop a rash and itchy  butt despite these minor drawbacks  overhauls ability to destroy and put  back together everything around him  including inorganic objects human bodies  and even his own body make this one of  the most overpowered quirks in the world  of boku no hero  and that is why overhaul lands at number  4  on our list at number three we have one  for all a quark used by all might and of  course deku one for all is a unique  transferable quark that was possessed by  seven other people in the past before  being passed on from all-mighty Deku the  ninth and current user one for all is in  fact a synthesis of two previously  separate quirks a quirk that stockpiles  power and a quirk that allows quirks to  be willingly transferred from one person  to another  the stockpiling side of one for all  gives its users superhuman strength  stamina agility speed and reflexes as we  learn from all might after he transfers  one for all to Deku once the quirk is  transferred from one person to another  the one who transfers it can still make  use of some leftover members of the  quark although they will eventually run  out the true workings of one for all  remain a mystery in many ways and we all  have to remember the mysterious way in  which deck who was able to break through  Shin Souls mind-control quark during the  school tournament art it appears that  the previous users of one-for-all were  somehow able to awaken inside of Deku  and bring him back to his senses  one for all also appears to become more  powerful as it is passed on from one  person to another because the Kirk  stalks files powers so the more people  use it the more power is stockpiled so  using this logic even though the  previous seven users of one-for-all were  not able to defeat the villain known as  all-4-one once all might gets the power  he is able to get the better of all four  one on two separate occasions the  immense power of one for all is clearly  evident throughout the series almighty  is able to become the number one pro  hero because of the power of this work  and Deku even as a student who is still  learning to master one for all is able  to defeat much more experienced villains  like muscular and gentle on his own  because of this quark Deku is even able  to defeat Qi Saki aka overhaul but not  quite on his own one for all has some  drawbacks such as the fact that until  the quark is mastered it will cause  serious damage to the user's body but  both Almighty and ik who have proven  that with rigorous training the  drawbacks of this quark can be  mitigated after watching both almighty  and Deku destroying powerful villains  left and right it can be tempting to  think that one for all is the most  overpowered clerk in boku no hero  however there are actually two quirks  that are even more Opie than this one  and number two rewind a quirk used by  Eddy a completely unique quirk unlike  anything that anyone has ever seen  before this quirk allows its user to  rewind another person's body to a  previous state an individual who is  touching Eddy directly when the clerk  activates will have their bodies return  to a previous state and actually the  reason that that kou manages to defeat  overhaul in the first place is because  Eddy was holding on to him and allowing  him to use 100% of one for all's power  because every time that who used it and  damaged his body arey squirt would  remind his body to back before he was  injured Aerys quirk is so potent that  chisaki used her blood to create bullets  that would make their target lose the  ability to use their quirk because their  bodies would essentially be rewound to a  time before their quirks had even  manifested on top of that Aries squirt  can rewind a person's body too before  they even existed literally wiping them  out of existence in a flash because  Eddie is still a child she is unable to  control her quirks so we don't know its  true potential  but Chiaki believes that once she  masters her quirk arey could devolve the  entire human race to their primal state  a quirk like this with the ability to  take away the quirks of others heal  people from all injuries instantly or  even erase them out of existence  in an instant is already a seriously  overpowered quirk but thinking about the  possibility that after mastering her  quirk Eddy could potentially dictate the  evolution of the entire human race is  the reason that rewind makes it to  number 2 on our list before we get to  number 1 here are some honorable  mentions first we have musculars muscle  augmentation quirk this quirk gives its  user the ability to enhance their  physical strength to an incredible  extent by amplifying their muscle  Viper's this definitely looks like a  really really strong work but we only  see it briefly because muscular is  defeated by Deku even though Deku is  just an amateur student at the time  which is why this quark didn't quite  make our list then we have Totoro Keys  have called half hot this is of course  the ability to use both fire and ice  based moves at the same time and it is  definitely an Opie quirk that ranked  very high on our list of the top 10  strongest quirks in battle however it  just missed out on this list because of  the strong competition from the other  quirks and finally we have meteos  permeation this quirk gives its user the  ability to move their entire body or  parts of their body through solid  objects including walls the ground the  ceiling and so on while this quirk can  be incredibly effective when mastered  horikoshi goes out of his way to tell us  that this quirk is extremely hard to use  and torturous to master to the point  that the strength of this quirk depends  more on meteos unflinching determination  then on the open nature of the quirk  itself and that is why it didn't quite  make our list and now at number one the  most overpowered quirk in boku no hero  is all for one used by Shiga Rocky's  master and the master mind behind the  League of villains also known as all for  one this quirk allows its user to steal  the quirks of others after stealing the  quirks the user can use them himself  including combining multiple quirks  inside one person to create extremely  effective offensive and defensive  techniques just think about some of the  strongest and most opie quirks out there  and then think about being able to steal  those quirks and combine them all in one  person the user of all for one can  combine multiple stolen quirks in order  to create more powerful super quirks  that would never have occurred naturally  and of course even one for all is itself  such a quirk which was essentially  created by all-4-one in Chapter 90 we  even learned that all-4-one can forcibly  activate the quirks of others as he  forcibly activates Kudo Geary's quirk  warp  in order to evacuate shigaraki and the  others before they can be arrested and  if that wasn't Opie enough  all-4-one can even transfer stolen  quirks on to other people  meaning that he can essentially create  his own army of villains with super  powered combo quirks and of course the  nomu are just one of all four ones many  projects I think that in terms of  potential all four one is the single  most opaque work in the world of boku no  hero stealing the quirks of others  combining them to create more powerful  super quarks that would never have  occurred naturally and also being able  to create an army of super powered  fighters by giving them stolen quirks  that they never could have gotten  otherwise is like the definition of Opie  and for that reason all-4-one is number  one on our list of the most overpowered  quirks and that is it for this video  everybody if you enjoyed it be sure to  leave a like to let me know if you want  to see more videos like this don't  forget to subscribe and Missouri smash  that notification bell if you want to  give us ideas for future videos be sure  to follow us on twitter and instagram at  anime uproar and let us know and of  course feel free to let me know down in  the comments if you agreed with this  list or if you would change some things  around I'd love to hear from you as  always thank you all so much for  watching and until next time see ya  space cowboys  you  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

